  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Instalação do Gedit</title>

    <para>
      Primeiro, construa a biblioteca gfls:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>tar -xf ../libgedit-gfls-&libgedit-gfls-version;.tar.xz &amp;&amp;
pushd libgedit-gfls-&libgedit-gfls-version;             &amp;&amp;

mkdir gfls-build &amp;&amp;
cd    gfls-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=/usr       \
            --buildtype=release \
            -D gtk_doc=false    \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Para testar os resultados, execute: <command>ninja test</command>.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;
popd</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Segundo, construa a biblioteca tepl:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>tar -xf ../libgedit-tepl-&libgedit-tepl-version;.tar.xz &amp;&amp;
pushd libgedit-tepl-&libgedit-tepl-version;             &amp;&amp;

mkdir tepl-build &amp;&amp;
cd    tepl-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=/usr       \
            --buildtype=release \
            -D gtk_doc=false    \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Para testar os resultados, execute: <command>ninja test</command>.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;
popd</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Finalmente, instale <application>Gedit</application> executando os seguintes
comandos:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir gedit-build &amp;&amp;
cd    gedit-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=/usr       \
            --buildtype=release \
            -D gtk_doc=false    \
            .. &amp;&amp;
ninja</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>ninja install</userinput></screen>

